// The Edict: the main gun of the Regent, the Regency's flying super destroyer. Every other
// gun on the ship falls silent, the whole hull gathers power for 15 s into one point on
// the keel, and a column of pinch-fusion plasma comes down to the ground, glassing a disc
// 2.4 km across. A hull-wide charge held in containment: everything is low and tonal,
// rough growls and a buzzing stack; not the Fallen's grinding rock and rings, not the
// warhead's pinch and seethe. Nothing beeps, whines or rings on a note.
(
    sounds: {
        // The gather, 15 s at the ship, played once as the Edict is ordered to fire, as long as the
        // gather. A heavy contactor drops the ship's other guns off the bus; then the
        // whole hull draws power: a sub swell climbing slowly, a choir of rough growls from end to
        // end of the hull starting at bow and stern and running in to the middle, the hull's plates
        // groaning and ticking under the load, a deep pulse coming quicker, plasma seething low in
        // its containment. Over the last three seconds the air is drawn in; then it all lets go at
        // once and leaves a held breath, nearly silent, for the shot. No beeps, no whine, nothing
        // rings on a note; nothing above 2.5 kHz but the first milliseconds of the clicks.
        "regency_edict_gather": (
            length: 15, peak: 0.72, room: 0.4,
            layers: [
                // The contactor: a heavy clunk deep in the hull and a felt drop as the guns go cold,
                // the guns' buses sinking away to either side.
                Burst(low: 35, high: 380, attack: 0.001, decay: 0.07, gain: 5, seed: 47001),
                Burst(at: 0.002, low: 26, high: 170, attack: 0.004, decay: 0.35, gain: 3.5, seed: 47002),
                Tone(from: 66, to: 28, glide: 0.7, attack: 0.003, decay: 0.8, gain: 1),
                Fm(at: 0.02, from: 150, to: 46, glide: 1.6, ratio: 0.5, index: 1.6, fade: 1, attack: 0.01, decay: 0.8, gain: 0.22, pan: -0.45),
                Fm(at: 0.06, from: 128, to: 40, glide: 1.8, ratio: 0.5, index: 1.6, fade: 1, attack: 0.01, decay: 0.9, gain: 0.22, pan: 0.45),
                // The ship drawing power: a sub swell climbing slowly from 26 Hz toward 70, its
                // harmonics carrying it on small speakers.
                Stack(at: 0.6, from: 26, to: 76, glide: 27, attack: 13.5, decay: 0.05, gain: 0.42, detune: 1.006, width: 0.3, partials: [(1, 1), (2, 0.7), (3, 0.4), (4, 0.2)]),
                // The charge running in along the plates: rough growls from all along the hull, the
                // ends first (wide), then nearer and nearer the middle, each pair a little out of tune.
                // The outer voices fade as the charge leaves them for the point on the keel.
                Fm(at: 0.8, from: 44, to: 84.92, glide: 26.6, ratio: 0.5, index: 2.2, fade: 1000, attack: 8.8, decay: 2.4, gain: 0.26, pan: -0.92),
                Fm(at: 1.05, from: 45.364, to: 87.553, glide: 26.1, ratio: 0.5, index: 2.2, fade: 1000, attack: 8.55, decay: 2.4, gain: 0.26, pan: 0.92),
